{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467788-is-there-an-estimate-on-what-old-exalted-books-are-worth","id":1467788,"title":"Is there an estimate on what old Exalted books are worth?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-14T07:20:15-08:00","id":1467788,"title":"Is there an estimate on what old Exalted books are worth?","content":"I am currently contemplating selling my collection of Exalted books. I don't expect to be making a fortune but I suddenly got by this concern that I might be selling something highly priced for pennies.<br /> <br /> So I thought I'd ask here. I have a solid smattering of 2nd edition books and I have the deluxe 3rd edition book from the kickstarter. Has anyone here tried selling their books and what were they worth?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1521-jang","name":"Jang","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1521_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-14T16:55:19-08:00","id":1467836,"title":"","content":"I'd suggest checking out Ebay &amp; Amazon to see what the used books are currently selling for.<br /> <br /> Ebay is my main pic, as that will show what they sell for if you want them sold with some expedience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-17T16:39:25-08:00","id":1468192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467788-is-there-an-estimate-on-what-old-exalted-books-are-worth?p=1467836#post1467836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd suggest checking out Ebay &amp; Amazon to see what the used books are currently selling for.</div> </div> </div> </div>If there are any indicators on how long an item has been up for, I think it should be considered that they're prices that the items are <i>not</i> selling for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-18T17:03:48-08:00","id":1468310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467788-is-there-an-estimate-on-what-old-exalted-books-are-worth?p=1468192#post1468192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If there are any indicators on how long an item has been up for, I think it should be considered that they're prices that the items are <i>not</i> selling for.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Absolutely logical.<br /> <br /> <br /> It does not take too long to see what is not moving.<br /> <br /> <br /> Although I've seen eBay go through phases or seasons, were some items do not move until all a sudden they do.<br /> <br /> <br /> A good question is how fast do you want your books to sell?<br /> <br /> <br /> With the holidays approaching, this might be a great time to unload your collection.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-20T11:37:39-08:00","id":1468415,"title":"","content":"I thought that Ebay had a way to view recently completed sales and auctions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is 